From 85e4f2c8be0a9f5d0e344632c89a7ce9e6e947c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: TAK DM fix <tak-dm-fix@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 19:13:09 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] TAK: DM routing, 2525 radio icons, radio picker, trails, map
 mode, stale-radio removal (v0.6)

- v0.2: DMs go only to the recipient's node when known.
- v0.3: radio markers carry no TAK team (2525 friendly symbol).
- v0.4: radio picker (show all / only picked) and breadcrumb trails.
- v0.5: "Show on map" mode (radios + clients / clients only / clients +
  radios without a client).
- v0.6: "Remove radios not heard for" (10 min - 2 h, default 30 min). Radios
  older than that are deleted from the TAK map (t-x-d-d) within a minute
  instead of being refreshed at their last position for up to 2 hours.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
