+ *
+ * Without it, every GeoChat DM is sent to the mesh broadcast address and every receiving phone hands it to its ATAK,
+ * which files it as a DM — so a message to one person shows up in everyone's DMs.
+ *
+ * Two independent fixes, each enough on its own when it applies:
